# Copy to .env.local and fill in real values.  NEVER commit a filled .env.
#
# Every VITE_* value is compiled into the browser bundle — no secrets here (CLAUDE.md hard rule 5).
# The app fails at startup with a readable error if a required value is missing or malformed.

# --- Required -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DQA backend base URL (no trailing slash).
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Directus REST base URL (no trailing slash).
VITE_DIRECTUS_URL=http://localhost:8055

# Role UUID granted to invited users. A public identifier, not a secret.
VITE_DIRECTUS_INVITE_ROLE=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

# --- Analytics (set both or neither; the app refuses a half-configuration) -----------------------
# VITE_SUPERSET_URL=https://superset.example.org
# JSON map of dashboard key -> guest-token dashboard UUID.
# VITE_SUPERSET_DASHBOARDS={"overview":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"}

# --- Optional -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Log API requests to the console. Dev only.
VITE_DEBUG_API=false

# Force feature flags off, comma-separated. See src/config/features.ts for the key list.
# VITE_FEATURES_OFF=assistant,support.chat

# --- Removed, do not re-add ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# The app refuses to start if any of these are present, because silently ignoring them is how a
# half-migrated .env reached production in the legacy app:
#   VITE_SUPERSET_USERNAME, VITE_SUPERSET_PASSWORD   -> guest tokens come from the backend
#   VITE_GROQ_API_KEY                                 -> assistant proxy lives on the backend
#   VITE_RESET_PASSWORD_URL                           -> derived from window.location.origin
#   VITE_DEFAULT_DISTRICT                             -> scope comes from access control
#   VITE_DIRECTUS_USER_ROLE                           -> renamed VITE_DIRECTUS_INVITE_ROLE
#   VITE_SUPERSET_DOMAIN                              -> renamed VITE_SUPERSET_URL
#   VITE_SUPERSET_DASHBOARD_ID_1..3                   -> replaced by VITE_SUPERSET_DASHBOARDS
# Any REACT_APP_* or REACT_PUBLIC_* variable also aborts startup: rename it to VITE_*.
